From the datasheet, **OP13LD8-005D** is a single **800G LPO OSFP 2xDR4** module: 106.25 Gb/s per channel, **800G Ethernet**, dual **DR4** (dual MPO-12), typ/max power **7.5 W / &lt;8.5 W**, and standards **100G-DR-LPO / LPO MSA / IEEE802.3cu / 2xDR4** all apply to that same product—not separate selectable modes. No amplified vs unamplified split and no per-mode penalty rows.

